---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service — Personal TRating" description="The legally binding terms of service governing use of the Personal TRating platform.">

<style>
  body { background: #f7f9f7; }
  .terms-wrap { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2.5rem 6rem; font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #3ab54a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  h1 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 900; color: #0d1a0e; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .lead { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #5a6f5c; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .effective-date { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #9aaa9c; margin-bottom: 3rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .terms-nav { background: white; border: 1px solid #e0e8e1; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .terms-nav p { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: #7a8f7c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .terms-nav-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .terms-nav-links a { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: #2a9438; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.3rem 0.85rem; border: 1.5px solid #c8e6cb; border-radius: 20px; transition: background 0.15s; }
  .terms-nav-links a:hover { background: #eaf7ec; }
  .terms-section { margin-bottom: 2.75rem; padding-bottom: 2.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e8e1; }
  .terms-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .terms-section h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0d1a0e; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
  .terms-section h3 { font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0d1a0e; margin: 1.2rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .terms-section p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #3d4e3f; line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .terms-section ul, .terms-section ol { padding-left: 1.35rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #3d4e3f; line-height: 1.85; }
  .terms-section li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .terms-section a { color: #2a9438; font-weight: 600; }
  .legal-box { background: #f7f9f7; border: 1px solid #e0e8e1; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #5a6f5c; line-height: 1.75; margin-top: 0.75rem; }
  .legal-box strong { color: #0d1a0e; }
  .warning-box { background: #fff8e1; border: 1.5px solid #ffe082; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #5c4a00; line-height: 1.75; margin-top: 0.75rem; }
  .back-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2a9438; text-decoration: none; margin-bottom: 2rem; transition: gap 0.15s; }
  .back-link:hover { gap: 0.65rem; }
  .privacy-cta { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#eaf7ec,#fff); border: 1.5px solid #3ab54a; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .privacy-cta p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #3d5c40; margin: 0; }
  .privacy-cta a { background: #3ab54a; color: white; padding: 0.55rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.82rem; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; } }
</style>

<nav style="background:white;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e8e1;padding:0 2.5rem;">
  <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;height:68px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;">
    <a href="/" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;text-decoration:none;">
      <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Personal TRating" style="height:52px;width:auto;object-fit:contain;border:2.5px solid #3ab54a;border-radius:10px;background:white;padding:4px;" />
    </a>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:1.5rem;align-items:center;">
      <a href="/privacy" style="font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:700;color:#2a9438;text-decoration:none;">Privacy Policy →</a>
      <a href="/" style="font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:600;color:#7a8f7c;text-decoration:none;">← Back to home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="terms-wrap">

  <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to home</a>

  <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
  <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    These Terms of Service constitute a legally binding agreement between you and Personal TRating.
    By accessing or using this platform in any capacity, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these terms.
  </p>
  <p class="effective-date">Effective date: 1 June 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Governing law: England &amp; Wales</p>

  <div class="privacy-cta">
    <p>🔒 Looking for how we handle your personal data? Read our <strong>Privacy Policy</strong>.</p>
    <a href="/privacy">View Privacy Policy →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-nav">
    <p>Jump to section</p>
    <div class="terms-nav-links">
      <a href="#definitions">Definitions</a>
      <a href="#acceptance">Acceptance</a>
      <a href="#services">Our Services</a>
      <a href="#trainer-obligations">Trainer Obligations</a>
      <a href="#client-obligations">Client Obligations</a>
      <a href="#reviews-policy">Reviews Policy</a>
      <a href="#ip">Intellectual Property</a>
      <a href="#liability">Liability</a>
      <a href="#termination">Termination</a>
      <a href="#governing-law">Governing Law</a>
      <a href="#changes">Changes</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="definitions">
    <h2>1. Definitions</h2>
    <p>In these Terms, the following definitions apply:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>"Personal TRating", "we", "us", "our"</strong> — the operator of personalTrating.co.uk, incorporated and operating in the United Kingdom.</li>
      <li><strong>"Platform"</strong> — the website, web application, and all associated pages and services at personalTrating.co.uk.</li>
      <li><strong>"Trainer"</strong> — any personal trainer who registers an account on the Platform to display their profile and collect client reviews.</li>
      <li><strong>"Client"</strong> — any individual who submits a review of a Trainer via the Platform.</li>
      <li><strong>"User"</strong> — any person who accesses or uses the Platform, whether as a Trainer, Client, or visitor.</li>
      <li><strong>"BMP Score"</strong> — the Body Muscle Percentage score calculated by Personal TRating's proprietary algorithm based on verified review data.</li>
      <li><strong>"Review"</strong> — a star rating and written testimonial submitted by a Client about a Trainer.</li>
      <li><strong>"Review Link"</strong> — a unique URL generated by the Platform and shared by a Trainer with a Client to facilitate Review submission.</li>
      <li><strong>"Content"</strong> — any text, images, data, or other material submitted to or displayed on the Platform by any User.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="acceptance">
    <h2>2. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>
      By accessing or using the Platform in any capacity — including browsing as a visitor, registering as a Trainer,
      or submitting a Review as a Client — you agree to be legally bound by these Terms of Service and our
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you do not agree to these Terms in their entirety, you must immediately cease all use of the Platform.
      Trainers who register an account provide additional express consent by completing the sign-up process,
      which constitutes a binding agreement between the Trainer and Personal TRating.
    </p>
    <div class="warning-box">
      ⚠️ You must be at least 18 years of age to register as a Trainer or submit a Review. By using the Platform, you confirm that you meet this requirement.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="services">
    <h2>3. Our Services</h2>
    <p>Personal TRating provides a public directory and ranking platform for personal trainers in the United Kingdom. Our services include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>A searchable public directory of registered personal trainers</li>
      <li>A verified review collection system via unique Review Links</li>
      <li>A proprietary BMP Score and national ranking system based on verified client feedback</li>
      <li>A Trainer dashboard for profile management, review monitoring, and ranking tracking</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any aspect of the Platform at any time with reasonable notice where practicable.
      The Platform is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We make no warranties, express or implied,
      that the Platform will be uninterrupted or error-free.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="trainer-obligations">
    <h2>4. Trainer Obligations</h2>
    <h3>4.1 Accuracy of Information</h3>
    <p>
      You warrant that all information on your profile — including name, qualifications, certifications, location,
      and biography — is accurate, complete, and not misleading. You agree to keep this information current.
      Providing false or misleading information is grounds for immediate account termination.
    </p>
    <h3>4.2 Qualification Compliance</h3>
    <p>
      You confirm that you hold all qualifications, registrations, and insurance policies required by law and applicable
      industry bodies (including but not limited to REPs, CIMSPA, or equivalent) to operate as a personal trainer in the UK.
      Personal TRating does not verify qualifications and bears no liability for misrepresentation by Trainers.
    </p>
    <h3>4.3 Review Link Usage</h3>
    <p>
      Review Links must only be shared with genuine clients who have undertaken a bona fide training session with you.
      You must not solicit Reviews from friends, family, or any person who has not received your personal training services,
      nor offer incentives of any kind in exchange for Reviews. Breach of this clause may constitute fraud and will
      result in immediate account termination and potential referral to the relevant authorities.
    </p>
    <h3>4.4 Prohibited Conduct</h3>
    <p>Trainers must not:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Attempt to manipulate their BMP Score or ranking by any artificial means</li>
      <li>Impersonate any other person or entity on the Platform</li>
      <li>Upload content that is defamatory, discriminatory, obscene, or in breach of any applicable law</li>
      <li>Use the Platform to harass, abuse, or harm any other User</li>
      <li>Attempt to access, reverse-engineer, or disrupt any part of the Platform's technical infrastructure</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="client-obligations">
    <h2>5. Client Obligations</h2>
    <p>By submitting a Review, you confirm that:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>You are a genuine client who has personally received personal training services from the Trainer you are reviewing</li>
      <li>Your Review is honest, accurate, and reflects your genuine experience</li>
      <li>Your Review does not contain defamatory, offensive, discriminatory, or unlawful content</li>
      <li>You are not an employee, family member, or associate of the Trainer, nor have you been incentivised to submit a positive Review</li>
      <li>You are at least 18 years of age</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Submitting a false, misleading, or malicious Review may constitute defamation under English law. Personal TRating
      reserves the right to remove any Review it reasonably believes breaches these obligations and to report
      fraudulent activity to the relevant authorities.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="reviews-policy">
    <h2>6. Reviews Policy</h2>
    <h3>6.1 Publication</h3>
    <p>
      Reviews submitted via the Platform are published publicly on the relevant Trainer's profile. By submitting a Review,
      you grant Personal TRating a perpetual, royalty-free, non-exclusive licence to display, reproduce, and use your
      Review content on the Platform.
    </p>
    <h3>6.2 Trainer Rights Regarding Reviews</h3>
    <p>
      Trainers cannot edit, delete, or suppress Reviews. This protects the integrity of the ranking system and client trust.
      Personal TRating will not remove a Review at a Trainer's request unless it is determined to be fraudulent, defamatory,
      or otherwise in breach of these Terms following a formal investigation.
    </p>
    <h3>6.3 Review Disputes</h3>
    <p>
      If a Trainer believes a Review is fraudulent or defamatory, they may raise a formal dispute by emailing
      <a href="mailto:hello@personalTrating.co.uk">hello@personalTrating.co.uk</a> with supporting evidence.
      We will investigate within 14 working days and notify all parties of our decision. Our decision is final.
    </p>
    <h3>6.4 Client Review Removal</h3>
    <p>A Client may request removal of their own Review at any time by contacting us. We will remove it within 7 working days of a verified request.</p>
    <h3>6.5 BMP Score</h3>
    <p>
      The BMP Score is a proprietary metric calculated solely by Personal TRating. We reserve the right to adjust
      the algorithm at any time. Trainers have no contractual entitlement to any specific BMP Score or ranking position.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="ip">
    <h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      All intellectual property rights in the Platform — including the BMP algorithm, design, branding, software, and
      database structure — are owned exclusively by Personal TRating or its licensors. Nothing in these Terms
      transfers any intellectual property rights to any User.
    </p>
    <p>
      Trainers and Clients retain ownership of Content they submit but grant Personal TRating a worldwide, royalty-free
      licence to use such Content for the operation and promotion of the Platform. You must not reproduce, distribute,
      modify, or create derivative works from any part of the Platform without our express written consent.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="liability">
    <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <h3>8.1 No Warranty on Rankings</h3>
    <p>
      Personal TRating makes no representation or warranty that BMP Scores or rankings accurately reflect the quality
      of any Trainer's services. Clients should conduct their own due diligence before engaging any Trainer.
    </p>
    <h3>8.2 Trainer–Client Relationships</h3>
    <p>
      Personal TRating is a directory and ranking platform only. We are not a party to any agreement between a Trainer
      and a Client and accept no liability for any loss, injury, damage, or dispute arising from any such relationship.
    </p>
    <h3>8.3 Cap on Liability</h3>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, Personal TRating's total aggregate liability to any User shall not exceed
      <strong>£100 (one hundred pounds sterling)</strong>. We shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special,
      consequential, or punitive damages, including loss of profit, revenue, data, or business opportunity.
    </p>
    <div class="legal-box">
      <strong>Statutory rights:</strong> Nothing in these Terms limits or excludes our liability for death or personal injury caused by negligence, fraud, or any other liability that cannot be excluded by law.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="termination">
    <h2>9. Termination</h2>
    <p>
      Personal TRating reserves the right to suspend or permanently terminate any Trainer account, with or without notice,
      where we reasonably believe the Trainer has breached these Terms, engaged in fraudulent activity, or caused harm
      to any User or to the reputation of the Platform.
    </p>
    <p>
      Trainers may request account deletion at any time by contacting us. Upon deletion, the Trainer's public profile
      will be removed within 30 days. Reviews may be retained in anonymised form for integrity and fraud prevention purposes.
      Termination does not affect any accrued rights or liabilities.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="governing-law">
    <h2>10. Governing Law &amp; Dispute Resolution</h2>
    <p>
      These Terms, and any dispute or claim arising out of or in connection with them (including non-contractual disputes),
      shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of <strong>England and Wales</strong>.
      Each party irrevocably agrees that the courts of England and Wales shall have exclusive jurisdiction.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before commencing legal proceedings, we encourage Users to contact us directly to attempt informal resolution.
      We will use reasonable efforts to resolve disputes within 30 days of notification.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="changes">
    <h2>11. Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to update or amend these Terms at any time. When we make material changes, we will update the
      effective date above and, where reasonably practicable, notify registered Trainers by email at least
      <strong>14 days</strong> before the changes take effect. Continued use of the Platform after that date constitutes acceptance.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="terms-section" id="contact">
    <h2>12. Contact</h2>
    <div class="legal-box">
      <strong>Personal TRating</strong><br>
      Email: <a href="mailto:hello@personalTrating.co.uk">hello@personalTrating.co.uk</a><br>
      Response time: within 7 working days
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem;font-size:0.8rem;color:#9aaa9c;">
      Last updated: 1 June 2026 · Personal TRating operates in the United Kingdom.
    </p>
  </div>

</div>

<footer style="padding:2rem 2.5rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;background:white;border-top:3px solid #3ab54a;">
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;">
    <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Personal TRating" style="height:44px;width:auto;object-fit:contain;opacity:0.7;" />
    <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#8a8f8a;">© 2026 Personal TRating · Built in the UK 🇬🇧</p>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:2rem;">
    <a href="/privacy" style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#8a8f8a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Privacy Policy</a>
    <a href="/terms" style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#8a8f8a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Terms of Service</a>
    <a href="mailto:hello@personalTrating.co.uk" style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#8a8f8a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Contact</a>
  </div>
</footer>

</Layout>

